WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.440
Money questions shouldn't feel like a test you never studied for.

2
00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:07.740
Paychecks. Insurance. Credit reports.

3
00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.680
Bills that don't add up.

4
00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:13.120
It's easy to feel buried, and hard to know where to start.

5
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.680
That's why we're building FinancialTherapy360.

6
00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.800
Guidance in everyday language,

7
00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:22.280
so you can see your whole picture, and what it means for you.

8
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.340
It's more than a budget tracker.

9
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.960
It's financial literacy, financial wellness,

10
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.220
and economic stability, made personal.

11
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.240
Start with your goals.

12
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.740
Then we help analyze your income, expenses and debt.

13
00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:39.080
Even determine where you are underusing your health insurance,

14
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.200
or missing out on benefits you didn't know you had.

15
00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.800
The things that shape your financial life.

16
00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:48.280
We take all of this and build a clearer understanding.

17
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.020
Then help you take your next step,

18
00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:53.240
at a pace you are comfortable with, with real confidence.

19
00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:57.800
A clearer starting point. A simpler way to think about money.

20
00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:01.160
And a mission built around understanding, not judgment.

21
00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:04.740
We believe financial well-being shouldn't be a privilege.

22
00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.860
It should be an opportunity, available to everyone.

23
00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:12.960
FinancialTherapy360. Helping everyone get more out of their finances.

24
00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:17.120
Sign up for our free review today, to see our services in action.
